# A cannonball must reach a named chunk and take it off the building.
#
# Every assertion here failed at some point during development: the shot
# reached nothing, the aim pointed at open ground, or the ball was correct on
# the server and invisible. Naming the chunk is what makes "it hit" checkable.

report                    # the intact city

look 0.8 0                # face the facade
probe                     # say what is actually under the crosshair
aim 0 5810                # now aim at that chunk by identity
verify-aim 0 5810         # and refuse to continue if the ray misses it

fire ball
wait 120

expect-detached 0 5810    # the chunk must have changed owner, i.e. come off
expect-bonds 1            # and it must have cost the building bonds
report
